rmgarch-modern-fortran
======================

This repository is an independent, experimental modern Fortran translation of
computational methods from the R package rmgarch 1.4-2.

Original package:
  rmgarch: Multivariate GARCH Models
  Copyright (C) 2008-2025 Alexios Galanos
  https://github.com/alexiosg/rmgarch

Fortran translation:
  Copyright (C) 2026 translation contributors

The original package DESCRIPTION declares "License: GPL-3". Some original
source-file notices also permit GPL version 3 or, at the recipient's option, a
later version. This translation is conservatively distributed under GNU GPL
version 3 only (SPDX identifier GPL-3.0-only), which is permitted by those
notices. See LICENSE for the complete license text.

This project is not an official release of rmgarch and is not endorsed by its
original author. It is experimental and has not been extensively validated
against the R implementation.
